  "steps": [
    "Blend Oats along with the chilled water for exactly 30 seconds (set a timer)",
    "Use a muslin cloth to extract the milk.",
    "Squeeze it well and then mix in salt, vanilla essence and honey.",
    "To make my cinnamon iced coffee, mix 1-1.5 tbsp instant coffee, pinch of cinnamon, salt, honey and 3-4 tbsp of water. You can use a frother.",
